comment_text:
So for you asking about why the Greatest Hits version of SH2 cost much more than the black label;

''The Silent Hill 2 Greatest Hits (GH) version is superior to the original Black Label (BL) release because it includes the extra "Born from a Wish" scenario (a Maria side story) and the UFO ending, plus minor graphical/bug fixes, making it the definitive PS2 version, while the BL is just the base game; the GH version often has better lighting and fog effects, though some prefer the BL's original misty feel.'' 

I usually don't comment on video's all that often but just wanted to say I'm really enjoying the series so far. Its been nice seeing you build up your collection, keep it up bud!
